WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.600
Our work evaluated the different
time-varying infection risks of different

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:08.700
levels of schools and the ventilation
rates required to keep infection

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.290
risk low. The energy costs,

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:13.430
per square meter and per capita,

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.310
were estimated on the national,

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:19.330
state, and county basis for both public
and private schools,

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:23.900
offering unprecedented operation
guidelines and financial implementation

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:28.950
for school operation during and beyond the
COVID-19 pandemic.
